e sequence of events for the deadlock are -\r\n- RPC X is being processed by a reactor thread Y\r\n- ASH collector tries to fetch tserver wait events, which calls DumpRunningRpcs\r\n- DumpRunningRpcs takes the lock and schedules tasks on each reactor and waits until they are done\r\n- Reactor thread Y eventually calls TEST_ShouldArtificiallyRejectOutgoingCallsTo\r\n- TEST_ShouldArtificiallyRejectOutgoingCallsTo waits for the lock which is taken by DumpRunningRpcs\r\n- DumpRunningRpcs waits for reactor thread Y to finish the task so it can release the lock and return\r\n\r\nASH was enabled by default recently (85247b4813553921db6ec2faf7154247e17873e8) which calls the DumpRunningRpcs code every second, that's why these tests have started to fail more now\r\n\r\nFailing tests (not an exhaustive list) -\r\n- [PgAnalyzeReadTimeTest.InsertRowsConcurrentlyWithAnalyze](https://detective.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=master&class=PgAnalyzeReadTimeTest&name=InsertRowsConcurrentlyWithAnalyze)\r\n- [PgMiniTest.TablegroupCompactionWithRestart](https://detective.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=master&class=PgMiniTest&name=TablegroupCompactionWithRestart)\r\n- [GeoTransactionsPromotionTest.TestOldRegionFailBeforeRPCSend](https://detective.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=master&class=GeoTransactionsPromotionTest&name=TestOldRegionFailBeforeRPCSend)\r\n- [GeoTransactionsPromotionTest.TestOldRegionExpiredAndRestarted](https://detective.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=master&class=GeoTransactionsPromotionTest&name=TestOldRegionExpiredAndRestarted)\r\n- [GeoTransactionsPromotionTest.TestRestartAfterCommit](https://detective.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=master&class=GeoTransactionsPromotionTest&name=TestRestartAfterCommit)\r\n- [GeoTransactionsPromotionTest.TestOldRegionFailAfterRPCBeforeAbortSentEarly](https://detective.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=master&class=GeoTransactionsPromotionTest&name=TestOldRegionFailAfterRPCBeforeAbortSentEarly)\r\n- [GeoTransactionsPromotionTest.TestOldRegionFailBeforeAbortSentEarly](https://detective.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=master&class=GeoTransactionsPromotionTest&name=TestOldRegionFailBeforeAbortSentEarly)\r\n\r\n### Issue Type\r\n\r\nkind/bug\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-14282]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-14282?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25132/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/25132/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":15517095463,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOBlCVUc6hY7MVzwAAAAOc5BYn","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/15517095463","actor":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallam